# Build context hygiene for the backend image (context = repo root).
# The backend Dockerfile only copies pyproject.toml + backend/, but keeping the
# context small speeds up `docker build` and prevents model weights / the SQLite
# DB from ever being baked into an image layer.

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
.venv

# Large, gitignored runtime data: DB, session audio, downloaded model weights.
# These belong in the mounted ./data volume, never in the image.
data/
**/*.db

# Frontend is built from its own context (./frontend) with its own .dockerignore.
frontend/
node_modules/

# Tooling / VCS / editor noise
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
**/.vscode
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
LICENSE
readme.md
README.md
